                        {
                            "text": "S'il continue à critiquer mes choix, je vais lui dire que je l'<w>emmerde</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "If he keeps criticising my choices, I'm going to tell him to <w>piss off</w>.",
